    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_01",
      "hash64": "64A882D93AB48EBD",
      "text": "我剛剛買太多食材了，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳能不能收下一些呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_02",
      "hash64": "64A87FD93AB489A4",
      "text": "說到野餐，\\n當然少不了三明治！\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳用我給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的食材做做看吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_06",
      "hash64": "64A87BD93AB482D8",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要順便參加我的野餐，\\n和寶可夢一起休息一下嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_03",
      "hash64": "64A880D93AB48B57",
      "text": "歡迎加入我的野餐。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要和寶可夢一起休息一下嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_04",
      "hash64": "64A87DD93AB4863E",
      "text": "看來[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳和寶可夢都活力十足了！\\n歡迎隨時來這裡休息。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_05",
      "hash64": "64A87ED93AB487F1",
      "text": "要是累了，可不能勉強啊。\\n歡迎隨時來這裡休息。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_01",
      "hash64": "B6B642BD7F6412CA",
      "text": "我的包包裡塞太多食材了！\\n分一些給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_02",
      "hash64": "B6B641BD7F641117",
      "text": "在戶外吃的三明治最棒了！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳用我分給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的食材做做看吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_06",
      "hash64": "B6B63DBD7F640A4B",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就和我一起野餐，\\n稍微休息一下怎麼樣？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_03",
      "hash64": "B6B640BD7F640F64",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要和我一起野餐，\\n稍微休息一下嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_04",
      "hash64": "B6B63FBD7F640DB1",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳和寶可夢\\n都變得很有活力了呢！\\r\\n隨時再來玩喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_05",
      "hash64": "B6B63EBD7F640BFE",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不用跟我客氣呀～\\n隨時再來玩喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_01",
      "hash64": "638C6EC7903E8A3F",
      "text": "這裡就在桌台市和深缽鎮的正中央一帶！\\c\\n吃了三明治之後，\\n我要繼續努力展開冒險囉～！\\c\\n……為了讓[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也能繼續努力，\\n我就把食材分給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_02",
      "hash64": "638C6FC7903E8BF2",
      "text": "對了，我聽說之前這一帶的岩壁會動，\\n不曉得是真是假～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_06",
      "hash64": "638C6BC7903E8526",
      "text": "就算岩壁移動，為了到時候不會嚇壞，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就休息一下再走吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_03",
      "hash64": "638C70C7903E8DA5",
      "text": "沒力氣努力了？\\n稍微休息一下再走吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_04",
      "hash64": "638C69C7903E81C0",
      "text": "不論是人還是寶可夢，\\n休息是為了走更長遠的路！\\r\\n要是累了，記得再來這裡啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_05",
      "hash64": "638C6AC7903E8373",
      "text": "這樣啊！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不要太拼命了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_01",
      "hash64": "937E7EF1480603A4",
      "text": "坡道比想像中來得陡，\\n爬得我喘吁吁的……\\c\\n這種時候呢，\\n就要吃東西來讓身心靈放鬆！\\c\\n我分一些食材給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也好好放鬆一下吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_02",
      "hash64": "937E81F1480608BD",
      "text": "要是肚子餓得咕咕叫，\\n能努力的事也努力不下去的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_06",
      "hash64": "937E7DF1480601F1",
      "text": "出門靠朋友，處世靠人情！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要順便在這裡放鬆一下嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_03",
      "hash64": "937E80F14806070A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也爬坡爬到累了嗎？\\n放鬆一下看看如何？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_04",
      "hash64": "937E7BF14805FE8B",
      "text": "想放鬆時就靠美味料理！！\\n有困擾時就要互相幫助！\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳如果累了，就來找我吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_05",
      "hash64": "937E7AF14805FCD8",
      "text": "真不愧是年輕人！\\n唉～我好羨慕喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_01",
      "hash64": "C0CBEAF7AA858279",
      "text": "一邊欣賞美景一邊品嚐的三明治，\\n別有一番滋味哈哈！\\c\\n這個送給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳來紀念我們相遇。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也要仔細品嚐旅行的滋味啊！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_02",
      "hash64": "C0CBE7F7AA857D60",
      "text": "吃了三明治之後\\n食力會一湧而出，\\r\\n旅途會更開心哈哈！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_06",
      "hash64": "C0CBEBF7AA85842C",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要順便在這裡停下腳步，\\n休息一下再走嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_03",
      "hash64": "C0CBE8F7AA857F13",
      "text": "偶爾停下腳步欣賞欣賞風景，\\n休息一下如何呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_04",
      "hash64": "C0CBEDF7AA858792",
      "text": "努力向前衝很重要，\\n但偶爾不妨停下腳步看看！\\r\\n如此一來，也能看到不同的風景哈哈！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_05",
      "hash64": "C0CBEEF7AA858945",
      "text": "匆忙趕路也是一種選擇！\\n但如果[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳想停下腳步，\\r\\n隨時來找我。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_01",
      "hash64": "BC54AAE0D733B186",
      "text": "我在漬沁市場用\\n很優惠的價格買到了食材！！\\c\\n但因為我吃不完，\\n這些就for you給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_02",
      "hash64": "BC54A9E0D733AFD3",
      "text": "和朋友一起做料理的時候，\\n帶各式各樣的食材去，\\c\\n能做出千奇百怪的三明治，\\n很好玩呢～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_06",
      "hash64": "BC54ADE0D733B69F",
      "text": "……對了！\\n這一帶路途險峻，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就休息一下吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_03",
      "hash64": "BC54A8E0D733AE20",
      "text": "從這裡不管往北往南，一路上都很險峻，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要出發的話先休息一下吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_04",
      "hash64": "BC54AFE0D733BA05",
      "text": "精神都恢復了吧！\\n冒險途中一路小心～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_05",
      "hash64": "BC54AEE0D733B852",
      "text": "如果[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要去西邊的漬沁鎮，\\n那可能我的擔心是多餘的了～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_01",
      "hash64": "E85BB6E7389DCA9B",
      "text": "我在大鍋湖看到奇怪的\\n寶可夢之後就靈光一閃！\\c\\n這是我使出渾身解數想到的三明治食譜，\\n請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一定要做做看！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_addrecipe_01",
      "hash64": "62CED2584FF6130B",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n可以製作[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]壽司風味三明治[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_02",
      "hash64": "E85BB7E7389DCC4E",
      "text": "一般來說，壽司用的不是麵包，\\n而是把食材放在米飯上來吃的。\\c\\n……換句話說把壽司放在麵包上的話，\\n美味也會變２倍！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_06",
      "hash64": "E85BBBE7389DD31A",
      "text": "我們在湖邊相遇也是一種緣份！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就在這裡歇口氣再走吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_03",
      "hash64": "E85BB8E7389DCE01",
      "text": "在湖畔野餐！很棒吧？\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要在這裡歇口氣再走嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_04",
      "hash64": "E85BB9E7389DCFB4",
      "text": "湖畔這個地方\\n為什麼會這麼舒服呢？\\r\\n多虧如此，讓我整個人都放鬆了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_05",
      "hash64": "E85BBAE7389DD167",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要是想感受一下湖畔的氣息，\\n隨時來跟我說喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
